  "releaseNotes": "> 0.12.0\n - More compatibility added for liquid\n - Breaking change of function parameters order to allow default values\n - Works on API towards 1.0.0       \n> 0.11.0\n - Add support for remaining liquid language constructions (fot with limits/offset, tablerow, cycle, include...etc.)        \n - Improve AST to text\n - Various improvement in the runtime\n - Add `this` expression\n> 0.10.0\n - Add support for liquid\n - Add support for AST to text\n - Add support for caes/when\n - Improve performance",
